   Stanton, N. A., Univ Southampton, Transportat Res Grp, Southampton, England.
   Baber, C., Univ Birmingham, Sch Comp Sci, Birmingham, England.
   Read, G. J. M., Univ Sunshine Coast, Sch Hlth, Sippy Downs, Qld, Australia.},
